act-by-id/evidence/feature-reach.md, on the dev host's target); it depends on five crates — blitz-test-harness, dioxus-native-dom, since 2026-10-07-driver-command-spans `tracing` (`{ workspace = true }`, no cargo feature — answered by the operator, 2026-10-07, at that chunk's plan forks; `Cargo.lock` gained one line for it, `"tracing",` in the escher-driver entry, and no package) and, since 2026-10-10-mcp-surface, `serde_json` (`{ workspace = true }`, no feature and no `[features]` table of its own, a reader of MCP requests only that writes nothing — the founder, 2026-10-10, «serde_json, только чтение», by question dialog in the overseer session, relayed verbatim by the overseer as his chosen option label, the English wording is the overseer's; `Cargo.lock` gained one line, `"serde_json",` in the escher-driver entry, and no package — it was already in both graphs through dioxus-html — and no platform adapter entered: packages/escher-driver/Cargo.toml:17; Cargo.toml:166; Cargo.lock:3106) and, since 2026-10-12-headless-screenshot, `png` (the workspace's, resolved 0.18.1, already in the graph — no package entered `Cargo.lock`), the encoder of a shot, its base64 written by hand with no crate taken for it — the key types its `press` needs come through the harness's re-exports `Key` and `Modifiers`, not a dependency of their own — it opens one `tracing` span per call handed to `Session::run` and, since 2026-10-10-mcp-surface, one `tool_call` span per MCP `tools/call` request, holding `tool` and `ending` only (the founder, 2026-10-10, «Span с tool и ending», relayed verbatim by the overseer as his chosen option label; the English wording is the overseer's), and emits no event (§Standard Contracts → Driver session), installs no subscriber, reads no env var and has no default state location; a hosted session expires — `serve` takes an idle expiry, `IDLE_EXPIRY` (1,800 s) for a host a command line starts, and a host that has answered no request for that long ends exactly as on `stop`, every answered request, a refused or malformed one included, starting the count again (the founder's answer to the orphaned-host question, 2026-10-10, relayed by the overseer; until 2026-10-10-driver-cli a session had no idle expiry); since 2026-10-10-mcp-surface a session's calls also cross from an MCP client over the `escher-session mcp` role's stdio — a child of that client, local to the invoking user, holding its session in its own process with no listener — the request-id echo (an integer, or a string of at most 128 bytes), a request line of at most 65,536 bytes and a result of at most 1,048,576 bytes its bounds: a boundary widening ratified by the founder (2026-10-10, «Ратифицировать как есть», by question dialog in the overseer session, relayed verbatim by the overseer as his chosen option label; the English wording is the overseer's); since 2026-10-12-self-description the command line's stdout and the `mcp` role's stdio also carry the program's own fixed text, held as `'static` data of the one table — the `help` self-description, a session error's remedy and each tool's description with its result fields — riding those ratified carriers, while text from a page, a call or a screen, a new carrier or a new exit still widens; a changed node's `differs` crosses as a closed set by the rule of 2026-10-10; no dependency added, `serde_json` still a reader only — ratified by the founder (2026-10-12, «Внутри, с правилом» and «help — десятый глагол», by question dialog in the overseer session, relayed verbatim by the overseer; the wrap's card confirmed, «Подтвердить всё», the same channel); since 2026-10-12-headless-screenshot a shot's pixels cross in band on those carriers — its PNG as base64 inside the answer on the session socket and the command line's stdout, and as an MCP `image` block on the `mcp` role's stdio — screen content and no closed value set, with no new carrier, exit or path argument and the 1,048,576-byte bounds unchanged, a bigger image ending `oversize` / `AnswerTooLarge` (the largest whole-screen answer on the stand measured 22,404 bytes, 2.1 % of the bound): a boundary widening ratified by the founder (2026-10-12, «В самом ответе», by question dialog in the overseer session, relayed verbatim by the overseer; the wrap's card confirmed, «Подтвердить все 16», the same channel) — as measured at escher-0.1.0/chunks/2026-10-07-driver-session/report.md, the `tracing` dependency and the span at escher-0.1.0/chunks/2026-10-07-driver-command-spans/report.md, the call on the wire and the idle expiry at escher-0.1.0/chunks/2026-10-10-driver-cli/report.md, the MCP crossing, `serde_json` and the `tool_call` span at escher-0.1.0/chunks/2026-10-10-mcp-surface/report.md, the fixed text on the carriers at escher-0.1.0/chunks/2026-10-12-self-description/report.md, the in-band shot and `png` at escher-0.1.0/chunks/2026-10-12-headless-screenshot/report.md
